From: UN1CA <unica@local>
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve UHD30 selection in vertical Dual Recording

Skip only the vertical-specific default-resolution dimmer. Keep stock
FHD30/UHD30 menu mappings and vertical output geometry. Preserve registers,
labels and all other dimmers, including the single-resolution device case.

--- a/smali_classes2/vc/u.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/vc/u.smali
@@ -2610,8 +2610,8 @@
     goto :goto_27

     :cond_62
-    if-ne p2, v2, :cond_63
+    goto :cond_63

     iget-object v0, p0, Ld0/i;->c:Ljava/lang/Object;

     move-object v4, v0
